\label{lemma-done}
Assume given data (D0), (D1), and (D2') satisfying axioms (A1) -- (A8).
Then the cycle class map $\gamma$ commutes with pushforward.

\label{proposition-get-weil}
Assume given data (D0), (D1), and (D2') satisfying axioms (A1) -- (A8).
